    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Restaurant is a free, responsive theme designed specifically for restaurants, cafes, bakeries, fast food outlets, cloud kitchens, food delivery services, and catering businesses. It offers a visually appealing and functional platform to showcase the restaurant menu, manage online orders, and sell meal kits or digital food recipes through WooCommerce for seamless ecommerce and food ordering. Users can quickly launch a fully designed site with One Click Demo Import, featuring pre-built layouts and banners that highlight chef’s specials, seasonal offers, promotions, or combo meals. Customizable sections make it easy to edit colors, fonts, and layouts without any coding knowledge. Fully mobile-optimized for a smooth user experience across devices, this food ecommerce theme integrates Contact Form 7 for table reservations, inquiries, catering requests, and customer feedback, along with Yoast SEO for improved visibility on keywords relevant to the restaurant theme and online food ordering. Opting for the Charitable plugin can further enhance functionality for donation campaigns. Ideal for modern food delivery platforms, café portals, bakery stores, and fast-casual dining websites, Flex Restaurant provides engaging menu showcases, online ordering tools, and customer interaction features, delivering a stylish, user-friendly, and high-performing solution for the cooking business."
    },
